; game.xon -- the delve set: a drowned mine under Kettle, twelve levels
; in four bands, no hunger.
;
; What this set turns on that classic leaves off: levels carved as
; caves, lit by sight to a radius, potions and scrolls known on sight,
; hunger as a store of food rather than a clock, gear that asks for
; strength and grows by a scroll, traps found by searching, the blow on
; a sleeper, and bands, each with its colour, its word on arrival and
; its guardian.

(set "delve")
(title "The Delve")

; The Lodestar, twelve levels down; held, it opens the flooded shafts
; back up, each level made again and roused.
(goal "the Lodestar" "*" 12)

; The bands, (band NAME TO . PROPS): each runs from the level after the
; one before to TO.  (enter "TEXT") is said on its first level; the
; (guardian "NAME") creature waits by the stairs down on its last, and
; they stay shut while it lives; (colour N) is the level's colour, 0-255.
; Each band carves its levels in its own shape, (level-style STYLE): the
; pit worked bord and pillar, the flooded reach of the old stair, the
; well-keepers' works, and the well-house round the stone's pool.
(band "The Galleries" 3 (colour 94)
  (enter "The Galleries: the worked mine, propped and railed, its lamps long out.")
  (guardian "fireman")
  (level-style pit))
(band "The Flood" 6 (colour 67)
  (enter "The Flood: the water stands here, and runs one way.")
  (guardian "undertow")
  (level-style flood))
(band "The Old Works" 9 (colour 65)
  (enter "The Old Works: dressed stone, set without mortar, older than the mine.")
  (guardian "warder")
  (level-style works))
(band "The Heart" 12 (colour 96)
  (enter "The Heart: the stone moves here, and the water is quiet.")
  (guardian "Old Man")
  (level-style well))

(player 14 16)
(unarmed 1 3)

; Food in seconds, a turn the time to walk a cell: half a day's at the
; start; felt with four hours left, weakening with one; a day's the
; most.  Past nothing, (starve N) costs a hit point every N seconds and
; stops them returning, in place of the faint and the end.
(hunger 43200 14400 3600 86400)
(starve 600)

; The lamp: half an hour of oil when full, lit full at the start or the
; first turn below; said when ten minutes are left; out, the cells
; beside are all there is to see.  An oil flask fills it.
(lamp 1800 600)

; Traps a level, hidden until stepped on or searched out beside; the
; kinds are in traps.xon.
(traps 1 3)

; A blow on a sleeper, or on one wandering unaware, always lands, and
; does this many times the damage.
(surprise 2)

; Creatures hunt by sight: asleep at the start, waking by the distance
; to them; those that wander make for somewhere on the level, not for
; the player, until they see them.
(hunt sight)

; Nothing is put within this many cells of where the player arrives.
(elbow-room 8)

; The first level is gentle: no packs, no traps, none arriving.
(gentle 1)

; A thing to eat on every level, the first time it is made.
(each-level food)

; Sight to seven cells, through nothing solid.
(view 7)

; Caves: walkers carve until this percent of the level is floor.
(level-style caves)
(cave-fill 38)

(creatures 4 7)
(items 4 7)
(gold 30 8 30)
(exp 10)
(regen 12)
(wander 40)

; Classes known without being tried.
(known potion scroll)
